# Shopify Storefront API — optional. When both are set AND every product
# variant in lib/products.ts carries a real shopifyVariantId, checkout
# creates a real Shopify cart and redirects to Shopify's hosted checkout.
# Otherwise the site falls back to a local mock checkout ending at
# /order-confirmation. See README.md → "Going live on Shopify".
NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_TOKEN=your-storefront-api-public-token
